(6099668, 898437, 105660, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture of potatoes.  I have never seen a potatoe plant before.  But if it wasn''t because the challenge is Potatoes, it could have been fresh yams for all I know.  What I want to stress is that the title is very important for the picture.  Always add something that relates to the subject in the title...Fresh Potatoes.  I judge points on title subject content and I am sure a lot others do too.</td>', 'This is a nice picture of potatoes.  I have never seen a potatoe plant before.  But if it wasn''t because the challenge is Potatoes, it could have been fresh yams for all I know.  What I want to stress is that the title is very important for the picture.  Always add something that relates to the subject in the title...Fresh Potatoes.  I judge points on title subject content and I am sure a lot others do too.', '2010-07-21 13:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
