(6099831, 898668, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great lighting for this photo. You have even brought out some of the details of the potatoes in the sack.</td>', 'Great lighting for this photo. You have even brought out some of the details of the potatoes in the sack.', '2010-07-21 14:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099832, 898406, 114225, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if anyone would do a shot like this. IT turned out ok, but the blown sky highlights are a bit distraction. Maybe cropping out the top inch of the photo would have helped.</td>', 'I was wondering if anyone would do a shot like this. IT turned out ok, but the blown sky highlights are a bit distraction. Maybe cropping out the top inch of the photo would have helped.', '2010-07-21 14:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099835, 898658, 114225, '<td valign="top">The challenge is Potatoes, not Pees... :)  Sorry, I can''t resist a good pun.<br/>This is a nice photo overall. I do wish we could see some more of the finer details in the chips themselves. I think that texture would have added a lot to the photo.</td>', 'The challenge is Potatoes, not Pees... :)  Sorry, I can''t resist a good pun.This is a nice photo overall. I do wish we could see some more of the finer details in the chips themselves. I think that texture would have added a lot to the photo.', '2010-07-21 14:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099836, 898589, 114225, '<td valign="top">I love the setip and lighting of this photo. Very well done.</td>', 'I love the setip and lighting of this photo. Very well done.', '2010-07-21 14:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099837, 898087, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job showing the textures. I like the composition (mostly filled frame) used.</td>', 'Great job showing the textures. I like the composition (mostly filled frame) used.', '2010-07-21 14:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099838, 898491, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well executed. The contrast of colors really makes the potato stand out.</td>', 'Great idea and well executed. The contrast of colors really makes the potato stand out.', '2010-07-21 14:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099839, 898640, 114225, '<td valign="top">This was a good idea, but the really bright highlights have detracted from the photo.</td>', 'This was a good idea, but the really bright highlights have detracted from the photo.', '2010-07-21 14:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099840, 898557, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully setup! The light landscape crop really works well for this photo.</td>', 'Wonderfully setup! The light landscape crop really works well for this photo.', '2010-07-21 14:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099857, 898565, 117831, '<td valign="top">The potatoes look a bit dirty and well no offense look a bit like vomit, I didnt know what Irish potatoes were, I took the time to look them up and realize they are like a hash brown pancake, but members might not take the time to look them up and I suspect that this might hurt you in voting. Also there is a whole lot of brown going on here, not a lot to focus on. I can tell that you wanted this image to make a statement, unfortunately I think it got a bit lost. I gave you a 5.</td>', 'The potatoes look a bit dirty and well no offense look a bit like vomit, I didnt know what Irish potatoes were, I took the time to look them up and realize they are like a hash brown pancake, but members might not take the time to look them up and I suspect that this might hurt you in voting. Also there is a whole lot of brown going on here, not a lot to focus on. I can tell that you wanted this image to make a statement, unfortunately I think it got a bit lost. I gave you a 5.', '2010-07-21 15:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099892, 897993, 117559, '<td valign="top">I like your title, and also like your composition. 9</td>', 'I like your title, and also like your composition. 9', '2010-07-21 15:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099894, 898582, 117559, '<td valign="top">What an interesting potato!  So full of character!  Great work a 9.</td>', 'What an interesting potato!  So full of character!  Great work a 9.', '2010-07-21 15:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099901, 898507, 117559, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, It is a creative idea, the title is perfect and looks like a lot of fun! 9</td>', 'I really like this image, It is a creative idea, the title is perfect and looks like a lot of fun! 9', '2010-07-21 15:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099903, 898617, 117559, '<td valign="top">I like, I would love to be able to do this to a potato.  A 9 for artistic work.<br/>Perhaps it would have worked better without the other potatoes floating next to it?</td>', 'I like, I would love to be able to do this to a potato.  A 9 for artistic work.Perhaps it would have worked better without the other potatoes floating next to it?', '2010-07-21 15:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099904, 897943, 117559, '<td valign="top">Irish??  I like this, how did you do the rainbow?<br/>Perhaps it would have been nice if the potatoes were a bit dirtier...they are too clean to be Irish ones, newly picked. :P  Still I gave you a 9 for the Irish connection.</td>', 'Irish??  I like this, how did you do the rainbow?Perhaps it would have been nice if the potatoes were a bit dirtier...they are too clean to be Irish ones, newly picked. :P  Still I gave you a 9 for the Irish connection.', '2010-07-21 15:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099906, 898427, 68947, '<td valign="top">REALLY CUTE!!! LOL  Made me smile!  <br/> <br/>The only criticism I can give here is that the lighting may have been made too harsh by perhaps, either over-brightening or over contrasting and coupled with the idea that it''s seemingly overhead lighting (the shadow under the yellow mouthpiece  and reflection on the peeler.  Other than that, the concept and the idea is really cute!  8</td>', 'REALLY CUTE!!! LOL  Made me smile!   The only criticism I can give here is that the lighting may have been made too harsh by perhaps, either over-brightening or over contrasting and coupled with the idea that it''s seemingly overhead lighting (the shadow under the yellow mouthpiece  and reflection on the peeler.  Other than that, the concept and the idea is really cute!  8', '2010-07-21 15:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099907, 898656, 68947, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Love the soft lighting and tones to this shot.  Works well 9</td>', 'Very nice.  Love the soft lighting and tones to this shot.  Works well 9', '2010-07-21 15:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099908, 898097, 117559, '<td valign="top">You have a really interesting potato, I don''t think you needed the extra props.</td>', 'You have a really interesting potato, I don''t think you needed the extra props.', '2010-07-21 15:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099909, 898338, 68947, '<td valign="top">Awwwww!  So cute!!! :)  Must have taken some time to put together! <br/> <br/>It''s hard to capture anything white/light, I know.  You might have been able to brighten this up a tad more and play with the contrast just a bit more to make the potatos stand out.  Then again, the softer look to this fits but, I''m sure DPC voters are used to seeing more highly contrasted and detailed shots as that is what "sells" in here.  Still...a cute shot! 7 from me</td>', 'Awwwww!  So cute!!! :)  Must have taken some time to put together!  It''s hard to capture anything white/light, I know.  You might have been able to brighten this up a tad more and play with the contrast just a bit more to make the potatos stand out.  Then again, the softer look to this fits but, I''m sure DPC voters are used to seeing more highly contrasted and detailed shots as that is what "sells" in here.  Still...a cute shot! 7 from me', '2010-07-21 15:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099912, 898627, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really creative.  I''m sure that this will catch a few "hmmmm''s" because the reflection give the entire shot an out of focus look until you train your eyes to adjust to it and see that ti''s the reflection that''s the cause of the effect.  I''m wondering if perhaps, cropping it down so that there was less reflective area might have been a help in that aspect?  7</td>', 'Really creative.  I''m sure that this will catch a few "hmmmm''s" because the reflection give the entire shot an out of focus look until you train your eyes to adjust to it and see that ti''s the reflection that''s the cause of the effect.  I''m wondering if perhaps, cropping it down so that there was less reflective area might have been a help in that aspect?  7', '2010-07-21 15:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099913, 898434, 68947, '<td valign="top">Cute Still Life shot.  It has a bit of "lacking" in interest so to speak but, still a cute shot.  6</td>', 'Cute Still Life shot.  It has a bit of "lacking" in interest so to speak but, still a cute shot.  6', '2010-07-21 15:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099914, 898005, 68947, '<td valign="top">Now, you''ve gone and made me want potatos for dinner LOL.  Nicely captured!  It just lacks a bit of interest in terms of why we''d want to see this type of idea. Can''t quite put my finger on what would have improved this to add more interest but, it''s nicely done! 6</td>', 'Now, you''ve gone and made me want potatos for dinner LOL.  Nicely captured!  It just lacks a bit of interest in terms of why we''d want to see this type of idea. Can''t quite put my finger on what would have improved this to add more interest but, it''s nicely done! 6', '2010-07-21 16:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099920, 898635, 68947, '<td valign="top">I like that you have the red tone against the green background as it''s a complimentary colour.  The only problem that I can say is that it''s lacking in interest.  It''s a closeup of a potato that''s nicely photographed but, that''s about all the interest there in it.  Not sure what you could have done to have improved it but, for the technicals and complimentary colours, 5</td>', 'I like that you have the red tone against the green background as it''s a complimentary colour.  The only problem that I can say is that it''s lacking in interest.  It''s a closeup of a potato that''s nicely photographed but, that''s about all the interest there in it.  Not sure what you could have done to have improved it but, for the technicals and complimentary colours, 5', '2010-07-21 16:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099924, 898307, 68947, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I''m not sure that I would have guessed these were potato plants so, while it''s a pretty shot....can''t quite give higher scores 5</td>', 'Without the title, I''m not sure that I would have guessed these were potato plants so, while it''s a pretty shot....can''t quite give higher scores 5', '2010-07-21 16:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099925, 898518, 99708, '<td valign="top">Very creative!</td>', 'Very creative!', '2010-07-21 16:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099926, 898282, 68947, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones, nice shot, great cropping and DOF but, without the title, I''d not have guessed this as a potato LOL   5</td>', 'Lovely tones, nice shot, great cropping and DOF but, without the title, I''d not have guessed this as a potato LOL   5', '2010-07-21 16:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099927, 898437, 68947, '<td valign="top">I''m sitting here, trying to figure out what it is that isn''t grabbing me with this shot.  It''s certainly clear, colourful, hits challenge, I''m liking the clouds, the greens against the browns but, it''s just not quite grabbing me on the whole.  I think that perhaps, had the potatos been zoomed in on more or perhaps, by laying down with the camera and pointing upwards, it might have had better appeal?  It may also be that the portrait layout of the shot might have been better as a landscape with more of the sides showing???  5</td>', 'I''m sitting here, trying to figure out what it is that isn''t grabbing me with this shot.  It''s certainly clear, colourful, hits challenge, I''m liking the clouds, the greens against the browns but, it''s just not quite grabbing me on the whole.  I think that perhaps, had the potatos been zoomed in on more or perhaps, by laying down with the camera and pointing upwards, it might have had better appeal?  It may also be that the portrait layout of the shot might have been better as a landscape with more of the sides showing???  5', '2010-07-21 16:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099930, 898275, 68947, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, nice backdrop props but, I''m thinking that a bit more contrast and light on the potatos might have worked to emphasize this shot more.  6</td>', 'Nice tones, nice backdrop props but, I''m thinking that a bit more contrast and light on the potatos might have worked to emphasize this shot more.  6', '2010-07-21 16:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
