(6100226, 898680, 102581, '<td valign="top">Well done!  I really like this shot, idea and execution.  My favorite shot in the challenge and I hope you get a ribbon!  10!<br/>1</td>', 'Well done!  I really like this shot, idea and execution.  My favorite shot in the challenge and I hope you get a ribbon!  10!1', '2010-07-21 20:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
