(6100331, 898557, 44765, '<td valign="top">Funny</td>', 'Funny', '2010-07-21 22:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6100333, 898640, 68947, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure on what to look at first here.  The wood backdrop''s lines really pull my eye first, then the hands being very fair are next and then, I''m drawn to the leaves because they stand out and lastly, to the potato (which is what we want to see first).  I think that had you simply placed the potato and dirt on a more neutral surface and left out the hands and wood below, you''d have had a much more intriguing shot.  Just too much going on in it.  5</td>', 'I''m not quite sure on what to look at first here.  The wood backdrop''s lines really pull my eye first, then the hands being very fair are next and then, I''m drawn to the leaves because they stand out and lastly, to the potato (which is what we want to see first).  I think that had you simply placed the potato and dirt on a more neutral surface and left out the hands and wood below, you''d have had a much more intriguing shot.  Just too much going on in it.  5', '2010-07-21 22:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6100449, 898557, 17507, '<td valign="top">You know what''s freaky? I had just about this same exact idea. I was going to put three potatoes in a sequence much like this and give it this exact title. Minor differences in the details, but striking to see it executed here. (I entered Mythical instead.) Nice work, and boy, those potato shapes sure are something!</td>', 'You know what''s freaky? I had just about this same exact idea. I was going to put three potatoes in a sequence much like this and give it this exact title. Minor differences in the details, but striking to see it executed here. (I entered Mythical instead.) Nice work, and boy, those potato shapes sure are something!', '2010-07-21 23:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6100552, 898427, 107603, '<td valign="top">A little disturbing.......</td>', 'A little disturbing.......', '2010-07-22 02:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
