(6100715, 898582, 117474, '<td valign="top">Nice work in putting scales on the potato. I''m far from any kind of expert on lighting, but is the light on his face a little too... strong? It just seems a little too bright on his ''lap'' I think.</td>', 'Nice work in putting scales on the potato. I''m far from any kind of expert on lighting, but is the light on his face a little too... strong? It just seems a little too bright on his ''lap'' I think.', '2010-07-22 08:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6100717, 898189, 117474, '<td valign="top">I think it has been oversoftened a little. Just looking at the leaves in the background they, to me anyway, they look a bit too smooth. <br/>Amusing shot, however. I wouldn''t like fries with him!</td>', 'I think it has been oversoftened a little. Just looking at the leaves in the background they, to me anyway, they look a bit too smooth. Amusing shot, however. I wouldn''t like fries with him!', '2010-07-22 08:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6100719, 898179, 117474, '<td valign="top">I had something similar in my shot, a knife near a cut up potato. I was advised that a clean knife would be best, but it really just made my photo look fake, that the knife was put there as a prop, which of course it was. <br/>My shot''s far from being liked, though. So maybe clean''s the way to go for good shots. <br/>You have nice smooth lighting. <br/>The knife might be a little over bright and catching the eye a little too much. The fries are nice and clean. <br/>The table is a little dirty. I think that adds to the character of the shot, but others mightn''t agree with me on this.</td>', 'I had something similar in my shot, a knife near a cut up potato. I was advised that a clean knife would be best, but it really just made my photo look fake, that the knife was put there as a prop, which of course it was. My shot''s far from being liked, though. So maybe clean''s the way to go for good shots. You have nice smooth lighting. The knife might be a little over bright and catching the eye a little too much. The fries are nice and clean. The table is a little dirty. I think that adds to the character of the shot, but others mightn''t agree with me on this.', '2010-07-22 08:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6100721, 897943, 117474, '<td valign="top">That''s a grand pot of spuds!<br/>I''m curious about how you got the rainbow in basic. Was it with a long exposure and sweeping of some colours? <br/>Hopefully it''ll be in the notes.</td>', 'That''s a grand pot of spuds!I''m curious about how you got the rainbow in basic. Was it with a long exposure and sweeping of some colours? Hopefully it''ll be in the notes.', '2010-07-22 09:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6100726, 898557, 117474, '<td valign="top">I think it might have been amusing to have put a fourth stage to the potato. Maybe mashed, roasted, cut as chips on a plate or something. Creative idea though. Bizarre shaped potatoes!</td>', 'I think it might have been amusing to have put a fourth stage to the potato. Maybe mashed, roasted, cut as chips on a plate or something. Creative idea though. Bizarre shaped potatoes!', '2010-07-22 09:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
