(6100772, 897943, 22392, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The only thing that bothers me a bit is that the colors on the potato seem somehow less bright than the rainbow. 7</td>', 'Nice idea. The only thing that bothers me a bit is that the colors on the potato seem somehow less bright than the rainbow. 7', '2010-07-22 10:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
