(6101649, 898451, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s a pleasant enough image, but you know what bugs me? I have harvested potatoes, and they are FILTHY. So this is just too clean by an order of magnitude to match the title, LOL. For some reason, that bugs me, but it won''t affect my score. Fair enough?</td>', 'It''s a pleasant enough image, but you know what bugs me? I have harvested potatoes, and they are FILTHY. So this is just too clean by an order of magnitude to match the title, LOL. For some reason, that bugs me, but it won''t affect my score. Fair enough?', '2010-07-22 23:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
