(6101657, 898695, 30861, '<td valign="top">But... But... Absolut is a GRAIN vodka, not a potato vodka. You need Wodka Wyborowa or some such. It wouldn''t be a big deal except the danged label is readable, and it TELLS us this is a Swedish grain vodka...</td>', 'But... But... Absolut is a GRAIN vodka, not a potato vodka. You need Wodka Wyborowa or some such. It wouldn''t be a big deal except the danged label is readable, and it TELLS us this is a Swedish grain vodka...', '2010-07-22 23:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
