(6101670, 898275, 96751, '<td valign="top">Is that a coffee grinder?  If so, then I''m not getting the connection, but it''s a very interesting object.  The composition is nice, although I find the background distracting, creating a very busy look.  And the overlay or mask deadens the image for me.</td>', 'Is that a coffee grinder?  If so, then I''m not getting the connection, but it''s a very interesting object.  The composition is nice, although I find the background distracting, creating a very busy look.  And the overlay or mask deadens the image for me.', '2010-07-23 00:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
