(6101693, 898676, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is almost so good. It''s clean, and well lit. But the composition seems a bit off, as though the tilt of the basket was non-committal.  It''s neither tilted enough, or too much.  And the crop  doesn''t seem to follow any of the normal photographic rules.  It''s neither centered, nor thirds.</td>', 'This is almost so good. It''s clean, and well lit. But the composition seems a bit off, as though the tilt of the basket was non-committal.  It''s neither tilted enough, or too much.  And the crop  doesn''t seem to follow any of the normal photographic rules.  It''s neither centered, nor thirds.', '2010-07-23 00:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
