(6101826, 898640, 23484, '<td valign="top">Cool job on the processing.</td>', 'Cool job on the processing.', '2010-07-23 08:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6101827, 898056, 23484, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Looks good.</td>', 'Cool idea. Looks good.', '2010-07-23 08:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6101967, 898640, 60495, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but the lighting on the image to me is not all that exiting. The hands and the wood background are both very washed out compared to the potato and the dirt. I think with better lighting the score would have been much higher. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the idea but the lighting on the image to me is not all that exiting. The hands and the wood background are both very washed out compared to the potato and the dirt. I think with better lighting the score would have been much higher. Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-07-23 13:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6101972, 898074, 60495, '<td valign="top">I find the potatoes to be fairly interesting but the tree trunk just does not add anything to the shot and the way some of the top items are cropped off makes the image look awkward. To me it may have been better to pull in tighter and get closer on the potatoes and try to create more interest using lighting to enhance the subjects.  Maybe even pick out one or two of the more interesting potatoes and working them. Hope the info helps, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I find the potatoes to be fairly interesting but the tree trunk just does not add anything to the shot and the way some of the top items are cropped off makes the image look awkward. To me it may have been better to pull in tighter and get closer on the potatoes and try to create more interest using lighting to enhance the subjects.  Maybe even pick out one or two of the more interesting potatoes and working them. Hope the info helps, good luck in the challenge.', '2010-07-23 13:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6101973, 898692, 60495, '<td valign="top">What a cute shoe horn. I''ll bet he has a shot at a ribbon!</td>', 'What a cute shoe horn. I''ll bet he has a shot at a ribbon!', '2010-07-23 13:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6102199, 898676, 98339, '<td valign="top">I like this, but a couple more things could make this a bit more interesting and engaging....yes, potatoes "could" be engaging...<br/> <br/>if you had turned the basket/photo to be at an angle...that to me would add more interest, it''s slightly turned now, but if it were slightly to the upper right side I think that would make a difference....something to get it away from that centered look<br/> <br/>the other question I have....did you do USM...I also think that that would make a marked improvement...finishing polishing this off you could say...<br/> <br/>no insult is intended...but yours stood out in the thumbnails and I had to take a closer look and remember...IJMO</td>', 'I like this, but a couple more things could make this a bit more interesting and engaging....yes, potatoes "could" be engaging... if you had turned the basket/photo to be at an angle...that to me would add more interest, it''s slightly turned now, but if it were slightly to the upper right side I think that would make a difference....something to get it away from that centered look the other question I have....did you do USM...I also think that that would make a marked improvement...finishing polishing this off you could say... no insult is intended...but yours stood out in the thumbnails and I had to take a closer look and remember...IJMO', '2010-07-23 18:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
