(6102410, 898437, 118410, '<td valign="top">i might have cropped the sky a little more</td>', 'i might have cropped the sky a little more', '2010-07-23 22:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6102412, 898623, 118410, '<td valign="top">makes me hungry</td>', 'makes me hungry', '2010-07-23 22:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6102464, 897995, 105660, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture but I hate the title.  The title has to be as meaningful as the picture and is best use to evoke a mood, create the feeling or at the very least relate directly to the picture.  Hide the picture a moment and read the title...what would someone expect to see with the title Housewife?  I score on title too.  Don''t kill your photo with a title that does not match...better yet use Untitled if need to. I really like the photo...good job!</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture but I hate the title.  The title has to be as meaningful as the picture and is best use to evoke a mood, create the feeling or at the very least relate directly to the picture.  Hide the picture a moment and read the title...what would someone expect to see with the title Housewife?  I score on title too.  Don''t kill your photo with a title that does not match...better yet use Untitled if need to. I really like the photo...good job!', '2010-07-24 00:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
