(6106608, 898047, 93934, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes and all the nice comments, really encouraging, I often look at this site, but have rarely contributed. I will be back.<br/>I had bought the lovely coloured small potatoes before the competition, with the thought of photographing them and trying them. They are old Inca Potatoes. I wasn''t impressed by the taste, very earthy. The big purple ones I had had for a few weeks, O.K. to eat, but the purple is a bit off putting, they do stay purple even after you have cooked them.</td>', 'Thanks for the votes and all the nice comments, really encouraging, I often look at this site, but have rarely contributed. I will be back.I had bought the lovely coloured small potatoes before the competition, with the thought of photographing them and trying them. They are old Inca Potatoes. I wasn''t impressed by the taste, very earthy. The big purple ones I had had for a few weeks, O.K. to eat, but the purple is a bit off putting, they do stay purple even after you have cooked them.', '2010-07-28 01:55:56.000000', NULL, 0),
